title: Analytics › Arrive and read the page
route: /analytics
intro: One page with two menus and a report button on top, four tiles, then four cards, and a fifth when recommendations were dismissed. It opens on 'This quarter' and 'All payers'. Everything is read-only except the menus, the 'Monthly report' button and the rows of the denial table.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the figures are invented tables. 'This quarter, all payers' is the fixed starting set (71% approved as asked, 1,070 decisions).
---
start s1 "Click 'Analytics' in the sidebar"
screen sc "Analytics\n'Where approvals are won and lost, and whether the advice is working.'"

group gTop "Top right of the header"
  screen m1 "Menu 'This quarter'\n(period)"
  screen m2 "Menu 'All payers'\n(payer)"
  screen m3 "Button 'Monthly report' with a document icon\nIt opens a window, where the files and Print are"
endgroup

group gTiles "Row of four tiles"
  screen t1 "'Approved as asked'\n71% · '▲ 6 pts vs last quarter'\n'1,070 decisions · this quarter'"
  screen t2 "'Top denial cause'\n29% · 'Thin continued-stay evidence'\n'311 denials · this quarter'"
  screen t3 "'Advice taken works'\n84% · 'Approved when applied'\n'828 requests · this quarter'"
  screen t4 "'Sent without edits'\n75% · 'As written, or a typo fixed'\n'966 drafts · this quarter'"
endgroup

group gCards "Cards below"
  screen c1 "Card 'Approval rate by payer'\nSix bars, best first"
  screen c2 "Card 'How people edit agent drafts'\nDonut and three-line legend"
  screen c3 "Card 'Common denial reasons by payer'\nTable, one row per payer\nUnder it 'Appeals overturned' and 'Denials accepted'"
  screen c4 "Card 'What helps most'\nFour ranked steps"
  screen c5 "Card 'Why recommendations were dismissed'\nShown only when someone dismissed a recommendation"
endgroup

screen hub2 "Under the header, a row of four tiles"
screen hub "Below the tiles, four cards and sometimes a fifth"
process p1 "All figures come from the chosen period and payer\nA figure behind fewer than 20 decisions is hidden"
process p2 "Nothing is stored: the address stays /analytics\nLeaving the page resets the menus"
process p3 "Other screens feed this page\nAppeal rulings and accepted denials from Denial Intelligence\nDismissed recommendations from Authorizations"

goto g1 "Continues in: Analytics › Period and payer menus"
goto g2 "Continues in: Analytics › The four tiles"
goto g3 "Continues in: Analytics › Read-only cards: payers, draft edits, what helps most"
goto g4 "Continues in: Analytics › Common denial reasons: open Denial Intelligence"
goto g5 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › Open and build"
goto g6 "Continues in: Analytics › Denial outcomes and dismissed recommendations"

s1 --> sc
sc --> m1 & m2 & m3
m1 & m2 & m3 --> hub2
hub2 --> t1 & t2 & t3 & t4
t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 --> hub
hub --> c1 & c2 & c3 & c4 & c5
sc -.-> p1
sc -.-> p2
sc -.-> p3
p3 --> g6
m1 & m2 --> g1
t1 & t2 & t3 & t4 --> g2
c1 & c2 & c4 --> g3
c3 --> g4
m3 --> g5
